| !RISC3D: RISC OS's 3D driver interface (see !Help). Seen at start-up
| from !Boot.Resources: sets RISC3D: and loads RISC3D, which loads the
| GPU driver from GPU itself. Programs need nothing in their !Run.
Set RISC3D$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <RISC3D$Dir>.!Sprites
Set RISC3D$Path <RISC3D$Dir>.
| Configure's RISC3D window keeps its choice here: Set RISC3D$Off 1 when
| loading a driver is turned off
IfThere Choices:RISC3D.Settings Then Obey Choices:RISC3D.Settings
RMEnsure RISC3D 0.09 RMLoad <RISC3D$Dir>.RISC3D
